---
description: Run the CI scanners before every push
alwaysApply: true
---

Before any push, run the CI scanners and do not push if either exits non-zero.

Semgrep, copied from `.github/workflows/ci.yml`:

`semgrep --config p/default --error --metrics=off`

Gitleaks, copied from `.github/workflows/ci.yml`:

`./gitleaks detect --source . --redact --verbose --exit-code 1`

`npm run check` runs that Semgrep command. Semgrep is not installed by `npm ci`. Install it with `pipx install semgrep`, the same install step as the semgrep job. If `semgrep` is not on `PATH`, `npm run check` exits and prints that install step.
